meta {
  name: List Tasks
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/fhir/Task
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Search Tasks. The gateway injects ?requester=<your org> from the token, so the
  result is only the Tasks this party requested. Needs system/Task.s scope.
  Run the Auth folder first to populate {{accessToken}}.
}
